              'AN APPROVED “CAN’T READ” CV IS IN THE POOL BUT THIN — nothing was extracted, so it matches Profile facets and is INVISIBLE to skill search, the most-used chip type. It must be marked thin in the pool rather than sitting there looking like a full CV.',
